{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01648","headline":"杂曲歌辞 升天行 · 僧齐己","name":"杂曲歌辞 升天行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"身不沈，骨不重，驱青鸾，驾白凤。\n幢盖飘飘入冷空，天风瑟瑟星河动。\n瑶阙参差阿母家，楼台戏闭凝彤霞。\n五三仙子乘龙车，堂前碾烂蟠桃花。\n回头却顾蓬山顶，一点浓岚在深井。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01648.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01648","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}